</span>Journal Entry<b>›</b></button><button class="quick" @click="routeTo('/list/BankReconciliation')"><span class="qa green"><feather-icon name="refresh-cw" class="h-4 w-4"/></span>Reconcile<b>›</b></button><button class="quick" @click="routeTo('/list/BankStatementEntry')"><span class="qa cyan"><feather-icon name="download" class="h-4 w-4"/></span>Bank Feed<b>›</b></button><button class="quick" @click="routeTo('/report/GeneralLedger')"><span class="qa navy"><feather-icon name="bar-chart-2" class="h-4 w-4"/></span>Run Report<b>›</b></button></article></section>
